提供的补丁：Windows 2000 用户下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=DD418CE9-699F-4D62-8282-5C4337BE5785，Windows NT 4.0 用户下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyID=26c9da7c-f778-4422-a6f4-efb8abba021e。如无法安装补丁，可在防火墙层面阻止对端口 1720 的外部访问，或禁用 NetMeeting 的 Remote Desktop Sharing 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ273854","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/140341","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1798","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-077","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5368","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20289","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0983.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0983.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0983","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0983.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0983.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8ed64b4e31209e933908eff50d33cf701402ff24/2000/CVE-2000-0983.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0983.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0983.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0983.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2000-0983.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0716.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0716.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0714","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0714.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0979","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/98/Me 文件与打印共享服务密码绕过漏洞","description":"Windows 95/98/ME 的文件和打印共享服务在验证共享密码时存在设计缺陷，仅比较密码的第一个字符而非完整密码。远程攻击者可通过发送单字节密码（匹配真实密码首字符）绕过共享访问控制，实现对受保护共享资源的未授权访问。该漏洞影响 Windows 95、Windows 98 及 Windows Me 系统，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。由于这些系统已停止支持，用户应升级至受支持的操作系统版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0979"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:54Z","remediation":"Windows 9x/Me 已停止支持，无官方补丁。建议立即升级至 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 版本；若无法升级，请在网络层面禁用文件与打印机共享服务（NetBIOS over TCP/IP），并在防火墙阻断 TCP 139/445 端口的外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97147777618139&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1780","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-072","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5395","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A996","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20284","https://github.com/Z6543/CVE-2000-0979"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0714.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0713","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0713.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0977","title":"Oatmeal Studios MailFile 1.10 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Oatmeal Studios Mail File 1.10 中的 mailfile.cgi CGI 程序存在任意文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 POST 请求向 \"filename\" 参数传入目标文件名，服务器读取该文件后将其内容通过电子邮件发送至 \"email\" 参数指定的地址，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 MailFile 1.10 版本，攻击复杂度低，危害中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0977"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 mailfile.cgi 脚本，或限制仅授权 IP 可访问该 CGI 目录。如仍需使用 MailFile 功能，建议升级到已修复此漏洞的最新版本，或在 Web 服务器层面对 filename 参数进行输入验证过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0172.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1807","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5358","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20303","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0977.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0977.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0977","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0977.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0977.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0977.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2000/CVE-2000-0977.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0977.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0977.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0977.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0713.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0713.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0713.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0711","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0711.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0976","title":"XFree86 Xlib Display 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"XFree86 3.3.5 及 3.3.6 版本中 Xlib 库的 Display 名称处理存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当应用程序调用 Xlib 库时，用户通过 DISPLAY 环境变量或 -display 命令行参数提供的值被复制到固定长度的栈缓冲区中，未进行长度检查，导致可覆盖栈上的返回地址和局部变量。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞执行任意代码，获取目标系统的控制权限。虽然仅允许数字字符写入栈，但通过部分地址覆盖仍可实现利用。该漏洞影响所有使用 XFree86 3.3.x 的 Unix 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0976"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53Z","remediation":"升级到 XFree86 4.0 及以上版本，该版本已修复 xlib 缓冲区溢出问题。如使用 SGI IRIX 系统，请安装 SGI 安全公告 20020502-01-I 提供的补丁。对于无法升级的旧系统，建议限制本地用户对 DISPLAY 环境变量的设置权限，并避免在命令行中使用过长的 -display 参数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0211.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5751.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1805","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20294","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0976.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0976.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0976","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0976.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0976.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2000/CVE-2000-0976.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0976.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0976.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0976.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0976.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0711.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0710","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0710.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0975","title":"Anaconda Foundation Directory 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Anaconda Foundation Directory 1.4 至 1.9 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 apexec.pl 脚本发送包含 `..`（点点）序列的特制请求，利用路径遍历攻击绕过目录限制，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的路径参数进行充分过滤和校验，导致攻击者可以访问 Web 根目录之外的文件系统内容。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危，攻击复杂度低且无需身份认证，但仅影响机密性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0975"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53Z","remediation":"建议升级 Anaconda Foundation 至 1.9 或更高版本，该版本已修复 apexec.pl 的目录遍历问题。如无法升级，修改 apexec.pl 源码，对用户输入参数过滤 `../` 等路径遍历字符，或限制脚本仅允许访问指定目录下的文件。若业务不需要，可直接删除或禁用 apexec.pl 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0210.html","http://www.osvdb.org/435","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5750","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20611","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2000/CVE-2000-0975.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0975.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0975.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0975","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0975.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0975.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0975.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0975.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e9abd745a1d6114f0fa7d3f67607c023bdf3fa37/2000/CVE-2000-0975.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0975.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0710.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0710.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0710.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0704","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0704.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0973","title":"cURL curl 及 curl-ssl 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"cURL 6.1 至 7.4 之前版本及 curl-ssl 6.0-1.2 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造超长错误消息触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行，可完全控制目标系统。攻击无需身份认证且复杂度低，危害严重。受影响版本需升级至 curl 7.4 或 curl-ssl 6.0-1.2 以上版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0973"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53Z","remediation":"升级至 curl 7.4.1 或更高版本。curl 6.0 至 7.4 版本在处理恶意 FTP 服务器的错误响应时存在栈缓冲区溢出，攻击者可远程执行任意命令。建议立即升级到 curl 7.4.1+，或避免使用 curl 连接不可信的 FTP 服务器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0331.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1804","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5374","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20293","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/1458fdc3af2b75a2d76e92cf6ef6566483b0f231/docs/CVE-2000-0973.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0973.json","https://github.com/curl/curl/blob/518a4dadff4a9fc89d8aebbb6bf48cd279235028/docs/VULN-DISCLOSURE-POLICY.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2000/CVE-2000-0973.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0973","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0973.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2000/CVE-2000-0973.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0973.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b7a3f185461ada4598db88be1e2c953e4d2cddec/2000/CVE-2000-0973.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0973.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0704.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0703","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0703.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0972","title":"HP HP-UX crontab 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.00/10.20 的 crontab 工具存在符号链接跟随漏洞（CWE-59）。本地攻击者可通过 crontab -e 选项创建会话，在编辑过程中将临时文件替换为指向目标文件的符号链接，退出会话后 crontab 会读取该符号链接指向的文件并将错误信息返回给攻击者，从而实现对任意文件的读取。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 10.20 和 11.00 版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，利用难度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0972"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53Z","remediation":"升级 HP-UX 至 11.11（11i v1）或更高版本，或安装对应补丁包 PHCO_24672（11.00）和 PHCO_24671（10.20）。如无法升级，在 /var/adm/cron/cron.allow 中严格限制 crontab 使用用户白名单，移除 crontab 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/crontab）作为临时缓解措施，并监控 /tmp 目录的符号链接创建行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0317.html","https://exchange.xfo